# Fuzzing crash data must never be committed by accident.
crash-*
leak-*
timeout-*
oom-*
hang-*
SIG*
*.asan
*.ubsan
core
core.*
fuzzfw-out-*/
tests/fixtures/**/fuzzfw-out*/
examples/**/fuzzfw-out*/

